OL,3,AIsraeli settlers attack West Bank
OL,4,Avillage and block Palestinian family's
OL,5,Areturn home
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo houses belonging to the al-Tubasi
OL,8,Ffamily in Jalud, south of Nablus, were
OL,9,Fset on fire in the raid on Monday night
OL,10,Fand Israeli security forces were also
OL,11,Ftargeted by settlers. Human rights
OL,12,Fgroups say the events show how Israeli
OL,13,Fauthorities are failing to take
OL,14,Feffective action against settler
OL,15,Fviolence.
OL,17,F"It was extremely terrifying, beyond
OL,18,Fwords. It's hard to imagine the
OL,19,Fsituation," Mahmoud al-Tubasi told the
OL,20,FBBC.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
