OL,3,AEstonia blames Russia for arson at
OL,4,Adefence company supplying Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia was behind an arson attack on an
OL,7,FEstonian defence company in the capital
OL,8,FTallinn last month, authorities say.
OL,10,FPrime Minister Kristen Michal said the
OL,11,Fattack on Milrem Robotics - which
OL,12,Fsupplies Ukraine with unmanned military
OL,13,Fvehicles - was ordered by Russian
OL,14,Fspecial services, but gave no details.
OL,16,FMoscow has been accused of launching
OL,17,Fsabotage attacks in a number of Nato
OL,18,Fcountries that have been helping
OL,19,FUkraine since Russia launched its
OL,20,Ffull-scale invasion of its neighbour in
OL,21,FFebruary 2022.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
