OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appearing in court as
OL,4,Aher lawyer pushes for murder case to be
OL,5,Adismissed
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS mother Lindsay Clancy is back in
OL,8,Fcourt after her murder trial collapsed
OL,9,Fearlier this month - watch the hearing
OL,10,Flive above
OL,12,FClancy's lawyer argues that the judge
OL,13,Fshould use his power to declare her not
OL,14,Fguilty. "Where's the evidence that she
OL,15,Fdid this?" he asks the court
OL,17,FProsecutors say the state "met its
OL,18,Fburden" in proving Clancy's guilt - 12
OL,19,Fjurors failed to reach a verdict during
OL,20,Fthe trial
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
